{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-11-19-how-to-create-circle-button-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To create circle button in react js, you can set  in . It will create circle button in react js. Today, I am going to show…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To create circle button in react js, you can set <code class=\"language-text\">border-radius: 50%;</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">.circle-button</code>. It will create circle button in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to create circle button in react js.</p>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./App.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> </code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">className=\"circle-button\"</code>  to create circle button in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"circle-button\"</span> onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>onClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  Button\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Create circle button example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">'./App.css'</code> and set <code class=\"language-text\">border-radius: 50%;</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">.circle-button</code> to create circle button in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./App.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> \n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">CircleButton</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> onClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"circle-button\"</span> onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>onClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      Button\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> CircleButton<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.css</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\">\n<span class=\"token selector\">.circle-button</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 50px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Set equal width and height */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 50px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">border-radius</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 50%<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Makes the shape circular */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #4caf50<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Button color */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> white<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Text color */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">border</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> none<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Remove default border */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> flex<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Center content */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">align-items</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> center<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">justify-content</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> center<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">font-size</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 16px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">cursor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> pointer<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Pointer cursor for interaction */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">box-shadow</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0 4px 6px <span class=\"token function\">rgba</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>0<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0.2<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Optional shadow */</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">transition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> background-color 0.3s ease<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Smooth hover effect */</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">.circle-button:hover</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #45a049<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* Darker shade on hover */</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">border-radius: 50%;</code> to create circle button in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 347px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ccd6863b1664cc76a3756fdf50be14ba/2baae/circle-button.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 74.0506329113924%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlgAAABXRUJQVlA4IEwAAABwAwCdASoUAA8APtFYpEwoJSOiMAgBABoJQBOkBshgb3YXD2AAy08eANeJvrZkILGCWA3SIbO6gAk8ARjUR+s5GywfrjhFP3UgdEAA'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, create, circle, button\"\n        title=\"React, create, circle, button\"\n        src=\"/static/ccd6863b1664cc76a3756fdf50be14ba/2baae/circle-button.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/ccd6863b1664cc76a3756fdf50be14ba/81b7c/circle-button.webp 158w,\n/static/ccd6863b1664cc76a3756fdf50be14ba/6ea66/circle-button.webp 315w,\n/static/ccd6863b1664cc76a3756fdf50be14ba/2baae/circle-button.webp 347w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 347px) 100vw, 347px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to create circle button in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"November 19, 2024","description":"Example of create circle button in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to create copyright symbol in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-11-20-how-to-create-copyright-symbol-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to create circle progress bar in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-11-19-how-to-create-circle-progress-bar-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-11-19-how-to-create-circle-button-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-11-20-how-to-create-copyright-symbol-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-11-19-how-to-create-circle-progress-bar-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}